{"manifest_version": "2.0", "session_id": "sess_3", "course_id": "course_9acfe7dbcd", "title": "deeper", "learning_goal": "", "generation_mode": "llm", "total_duration_ms": 42239, "actions": [{"type": "board", "step_id": 2, "board_uid": 1, "title": "换个讲法：接力赛跑", "board_content": "多项式 = 接力队，每项 = 一个选手\n选手越多，跑得越远\n固定选手 → 跑不远\n选手可无限加 → 多远都能到", "layout": "newcol", "reveal_gate_step": 1, "page_id": "page-1"}, {"type": "speak", "step_id": 1, "spoken_text": "把多项式想成接力赛跑，每一项就是一个选手。选手越多，能跑的总路程就越远。固定几个选手当然跑不远，但选手可以无限增加，所以再远也能跑到。看这一行，关键不是能不能，而是选手够不够多。"}, {"type": "tts_segment", "step_id": 1, "audio_url": null, "duration_ms": 21607, "tts_cjk": 79, "tts_latin": 0, "speed": 1.0, "skipped": false, "marks": [[0, 0], [1, 248], [2, 497], [3, 746], [4, 994], [5, 1243], [6, 1492], [7, 1740], [8, 1989], [9, 2238], [10, 2486], [11, 2685], [12, 2934], [13, 3183], [14, 3431], [15, 3680], [16, 3929], [17, 4177], [18, 4426], [19, 4675], [20, 4924], [21, 5123], [22, 5376], [23, 5629], [24, 5882], [25, 6135], [26, 6337], [27, 6590], [28, 6843], [29, 7097], [30, 7350], [31, 7603], [32, 7856], [33, 8109], [34, 8362], [35, 8615], [36, 8818], [37, 9063], [38, 9309], [39, 9554], [40, 9800], [41, 10045], [42, 10291], [43, 10537], [44, 10782], [45, 11028], [46, 11273], [47, 11519], [48, 11715], [49, 11961], [50, 12207], [51, 12452], [52, 12698], [53, 12943], [54, 13189], [55, 13435], [56, 13680], [57, 13926], [58, 14122], [59, 14368], [60, 14613], [61, 14859], [62, 15105], [63, 15350], [64, 15596], [65, 15841], [66, 16087], [67, 16284], [68, 16532], [69, 16781], [70, 17030], [71, 17278], [72, 17477], [73, 17726], [74, 17975], [75, 18224], [76, 18472], [77, 18721], [78, 18970], [79, 19219], [80, 19418], [81, 19666], [82, 19915], [83, 20164], [84, 20413], [85, 20661], [86, 20910], [87, 21159], [88, 21408], [89, 21607]]}, {"type": "board", "step_id": 4, "board_uid": 2, "title": "换个讲法：数字例子", "board_content": "$e^{10} \\approx 22026$\n前10项 $\\approx 12842$，差得远\n前20项 $\\approx 21991$，很接近\n项数越多，越贴住", "layout": "follow", "reveal_gate_step": 3, "page_id": "page-1"}, {"type": "speak", "step_id": 3, "spoken_text": "看这一行，x 等于 10 时，e 的 10 次方约等于 22026。取多项式前 10 项算一下，结果约 12842，差得远。但取前 20 项，结果约 21991，已经很接近了。项数越多，越贴住。所以多远都能贴住，只要项数够多。"}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 5, "target_board_uid": 2, "snippet": "前10项 $\\approx 12842$，差得远", "color": null, "during_step": 3, "at_ms": 7221}, {"type": "tts_segment", "step_id": 3, "audio_url": null, "duration_ms": 20632, "tts_cjk": 62, "tts_latin": 25, "speed": 1.0, "skipped": false, "marks": [[0, 0], [1, 228], [2, 457], [3, 686], [4, 914], [5, 1097], [6, 1200], [7, 1235], [8, 1463], [9, 1692], [10, 1726], [11, 1829], [12, 1932], [13, 1967], [14, 2195], [15, 2378], [16, 2481], [17, 2516], [18, 2744], [19, 2779], [20, 2882], [21, 2985], [22, 3019], [23, 3248], [24, 3476], [25, 3705], [26, 3934], [27, 4163], [28, 4197], [29, 4300], [30, 4403], [31, 4506], [32, 4609], [33, 4712], [34, 4895], [35, 5133], [36, 5371], [37, 5610], [38, 5848], [39, 6087], [40, 6122], [41, 6230], [42, 6337], [43, 6373], [44, 6611], [45, 6850], [46, 7088], [47, 7326], [48, 7517], [49, 7756], [50, 7994], [51, 8233], [52, 8268], [53, 8376], [54, 8483], [55, 8590], [56, 8697], [57, 8805], [58, 8995], [59, 9234], [60, 9472], [61, 9711], [62, 9902], [63, 10140], [64, 10378], [65, 10617], [66, 10653], [67, 10760], [68, 10867], [69, 10903], [70, 11142], [71, 11332], [72, 11571], [73, 11809], [74, 12048], [75, 12084], [76, 12191], [77, 12298], [78, 12405], [79, 12513], [80, 12620], [81, 12811], [82, 13049], [83, 13288], [84, 13526], [85, 13765], [86, 14003], [87, 14242], [88, 14433], [89, 14696], [90, 14959], [91, 15223], [92, 15486], [93, 15697], [94, 15961], [95, 16224], [96, 16488], [97, 16699], [98, 16951], [99, 17203], [100, 17455], [101, 17707], [102, 17959], [103, 18211], [104, 18463], [105, 18715], [106, 18917], [107, 19169], [108, 19421], [109, 19673], [110, 19926], [111, 20178], [112, 20430], [113, 20632]]}, {"type": "done", "step_id": 6}], "exercises": [], "keypoints": 